{
  "info": {
    "name": "Nimbus API (Weather & City Guide)",
    "description": "Course collection. 1) Pick the environment top-right: \"Nimbus · Render (live)\" for the hosted API, or \"Nimbus · Local\" (npm start). 2) Run \"Login (saves token)\" once. 3) Use any request. Demo login: demo@nimbus.app / demo1234. The hosted API sleeps after ~15 min idle: the first request can take up to a minute. On the hosted API, ?simulate=offline returns 502 instead of dropping the connection. Pairs with the Nimbus Figma design.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
